<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <main class="legal container">
    <div class="legal__header">
      <a href="/" class="brand">
        <span class="brand__crest"><span><%= brand.initials %></span></span>
        <span class="brand__name"><%= brand.name %></span>
      </a>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal__updated">Last updated: <%= updated %></p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal__body">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how <strong><%= brand.name %></strong> ("we", "us", "our"),
        located at <%= brand.address %>, collects, uses, stores and protects personal
        information when you visit <strong><%= config.baseUrl %></strong> or message us on
        WhatsApp. It applies to our website and to our use of the Meta WhatsApp Business
        Platform (WhatsApp Cloud API).
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p><strong>a) Information you give us directly</strong> — when you submit an enquiry,
        bespoke request, wholesale request or appointment request on our website, we collect
        your name, phone number, email address (if provided), your message, and the product
        you're enquiring about.</p>
      <p><strong>b) Information from WhatsApp conversations</strong> — when you message us on
        WhatsApp, or we reply to you, Meta's WhatsApp Business Platform shares with us your
        WhatsApp phone number (WA ID), the profile name set on your WhatsApp account, the
        content of the messages you send us, and delivery/read status metadata.</p>
      <p><strong>c) Technical information</strong> — like most websites, our server
        automatically logs basic technical data (IP address, browser type, pages requested,
        timestamps) for security, abuse prevention and diagnostics. We do not use third-party
        advertising trackers or analytics cookies on this site.</p>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your enquiry, share catalogue details, pricing and availability.</li>
        <li>To communicate with you about bespoke orders, wholesale supply, or showroom
          appointments.</li>
        <li>To send you a WhatsApp acknowledgement when you contact us, and to reply to your
          messages personally.</li>
        <li>To maintain business and legal records (for example, GST and invoicing records for
          confirmed purchases).</li>
        <li>To detect, prevent and address spam, fraud or misuse of our enquiry form.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We only message you on WhatsApp if you have messaged us first, submitted an enquiry on
        our website, or otherwise given us your number for that purpose.</p>

      <h2>3. WhatsApp Business Platform</h2>
      <p>We use Meta's WhatsApp Business Platform (Cloud API) to send and receive messages.
        Meta Platforms, Inc. processes message data on our behalf as part of providing this
        service, in accordance with the
        <a href="https://www.whatsapp.com/legal/business-data-processing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp Business Data Processing Terms</a>
        and Meta's own
        <a href="https://www.facebook.com/privacy/policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Privacy Policy</a>.
        We do not control how Meta itself processes data on its platform — please refer to
        those documents for details.</p>

      <h2>4. Sharing of Information</h2>
      <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information. We share it only with:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Meta Platforms, Inc. — to deliver and receive WhatsApp messages.</li>
        <li>Our website hosting provider — to operate this website.</li>
        <li>Government or regulatory authorities, where required by applicable law.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Data Storage &amp; Security</h2>
      <p>Enquiry and message records are stored on our hosting provider's servers. Our website
        is served over HTTPS, and our WhatsApp webhook verifies Meta's signature on every
        incoming request to prevent tampering. While we take reasonable steps to protect your
        information, no method of storage or transmission over the internet is completely
        secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2>6. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>We keep enquiry and WhatsApp conversation records only for as long as reasonably
        needed to respond to you and for legitimate business or legal record-keeping (for
        example, sale/invoice records required under Indian tax law), after which they are
        deleted or anonymised. You can request earlier deletion at any time — see
        <a href="/data-deletion">Data Deletion</a>.</p>

      <h2>7. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You may ask us, at any time, to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>tell you what personal data we hold about you;</li>
        <li>correct inaccurate information; or</li>
        <li>delete your personal data from our systems.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>See our <a href="/data-deletion">Data Deletion instructions</a> for how to submit such
        a request.</p>

      <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Our website and WhatsApp channel are intended for adults inquiring about jewellery
        purchases. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

      <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on
        this page with a revised "Last updated" date.</p>

      <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>For any privacy-related question or request, reach us on WhatsApp or by phone at
        <strong><%= brand.phoneDisplay %></strong>, or visit us at <%= brand.address %>.</p>

      <p class="legal__back"><a href="/">&larr; Back to home</a></p>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
